    <Folder>
      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The US Navy&#39;s carrier strike groups and amphibious ready groups continue to operate worldwide, while the French Navy intercepts a suspected shadow fleet tanker. The Philippine and Chinese forces engage in increased incidents in the South China Sea and Luzon Strait. The US Navy&#39;s USS Arleigh Burke destroyer undergoes maintenance in Spain. The GAO report highlights the challenges with precision navigation systems, and the DLA Distribution San Diego hosted officials to discuss audit readiness. The Army is reforming military construction projects to improve infrastructure and Soldier quality of life.</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>0,0,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
    </Folder>
